 2. 🦠 COVID rises on brink of holidays 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Recreated from Pandemic Mitigation Collaborative . Map: Axios There's a lot of COVID going around, and acute respiratory illness is on the rise heading into Thanksgiving, Axios' Caitlin Owens writes. 

 Why it matters: The pandemic's crisis phase is long behind us. But it's still not holiday fun to catch COVID. 🧮 By the numbers: The Pandemic Mitigation Collaborative, a Tulane University project, estimates 1.4 million new daily infections, the highest level in 14+ months.

 Flu infections are also rising in 34 states. RSV cases are increasing in 39. Keep reading ... Get Axios Future of Health Care . 

 
 
